  MageRide Driver — iOS · C088 driver-ios-dashboard-dispatch. English, the development region.

  SCOPE. Cluster 3 only: SCR-DI-010 the Mode C dashboard, SCR-DI-011 the Mode A/B Start/End Journey
  dashboard, SCR-DI-013 Directional Travel, SCR-DI-014 the fifteen-second dispatch takeover,
